{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"report_supported\": \"partly\",\n  \"judge_supported\": \"yes\",\n  \"report_quotes\": [\n    \"Further, FoG-Turn – but not Pre FoG-Turn – showed prolonged beta bursts.\",\n    \"Post-hoc comparison indicated a significantly lower proportion of burst durations (− 11.09% of bursts, adjusted P = 0.010) in the 100–200 ms interval (window 1) in Pre FoG-Turn compared to Regular Walking (Fig. 5C).\",\n    \"In contrast, burst duration during turning was positively associated with FoG-Turns (β = 0.709, P = 0.001), whereas burst duration during the pre-turn phase showed only a trend toward significance (β = −0.317, P = 0.091).\",\n    \"Rather than directly addressing pre-FoG detection, we here combined burst-information and kinematic features that reliably differentiate pathological from physiological turning states.\",\n    \"Here, we could show that freezing while turning was specifically associated with a significant redistribution of bursts longer than 400 ms, whereas the preceding transition period was characterized by a significant reduction in short bursts (< 200 ms).\"\n  ],\n  \"judge_quotes\": [\n    \"FoG-Turns were defined as turns containing clinically annotated FoG.\",\n    \"Turn transitions were studied provided our interest in pre-monitory STN activation abnormalities preceding a turn. Therefore, we analysed the 3-second epochs before turn start of either locomotor state and labelled epochs Pre Reg-Turn if preceding a Reg-Turn, and Pre FoG-Turn if preceding a FoG-Turn.\",\n    \"In contrast, burst duration during turning was positively associated with FoG-Turns (β = 0.709, P = 0.001), whereas burst duration during the pre-turn phase showed only a trend toward significance (β = −0.317, P = 0.091).\",\n    \"Post-hoc comparison indicated a significantly lower proportion of burst durations (− 11.09% of bursts, adjusted P = 0.010) in the 100–200 ms interval (window 1) in Pre FoG-Turn compared to Regular Walking (Fig. 5C).\",\n    \"Compared to regular walking, we further observed a significant shift in the distribution of burst durations, with a reduction in short duration bursts in the transitions preceding FoG-Turns, as well as an increase in long lasting bursts in FoG-Turns.\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"报告的说法部分有依据，但缺少会改变结论的关键限定。原文确实发现冻结前转弯阶段存在beta burst持续时间分布变化，具体表现为100–200 ms短burst比例显著下降（P=0.010）；而且将Pre-Turn burst duration纳入了分类模型。但是，这不等于证明冻结前长burst比例增加、累计持续时间增加，或存在可重复的冻结前预测标志。尤其是模型中Pre-Turn burst duration与冻结发生的关联仅达到趋势水平（β=-0.317，P=0.091），模型的分类目标是区分FoG-Turn与Reg-Turn，而非直接预测冻结发生。作者还明确指出，研究并非直接针对pre-FoG detection。相反，长burst（>400 ms）分布增加以及burst duration与FoG-Turn显著相关（β=0.709，P=0.001），均属于冻结转弯期间的结果。因此，指控者对原文结果的时序、方向和统计显著性的描述有全文依据。报告如果将冻结期间的长burst结果作为冻结前预测证据，就是混淆了两个不同阶段。不过，原文自身的Discussion实际上明确区分了Pre FoG-Turn与FoG-Turn，不能将这种混淆归因于原文作者。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e092598e-c68b-4035-9d7d-5cfe1cfff546", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261114T071109554965Z", "elapsed_seconds": 172.531, "completed_utc": "2026-11-14T07:14:02.109537+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "bf62d1b812c71e7be929d7ca40e5f0bb58256131045c7756c7f5d7c14dd29f72", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261114T071109554965Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "967d1916dbb5d4fa99f8ceb3ef3d48d991ff27f31c5d4e2dc6d55795027e188c"}}}
